{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"You can install TanStack Ranger with any "},{"type":"link","href":"https://npmjs.com","children":[{"type":"text","value":"NPM"}]},{"type":"text","value":" package manager."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Depending on your framework of choice, install one of the following packages:"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"./framework/react/react-ranger.md","children":[{"type":"text","value":"React"}]}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Solid (coming soon!)"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Vue (coming soon!)"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Svelte (coming soon!)"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Angular (coming soon!)"}]}]}]}],"headings":[]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\nYou can install TanStack Ranger with any [NPM](https://npmjs.com) package manager.\n\nDepending on your framework of choice, install one of the following packages:\n\n- [React](./framework/react/react-ranger.md)\n- Solid (coming soon!)\n- Vue (coming soon!)\n- Svelte (coming soon!)\n- Angular (coming soon!)\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\ntitle: Installation\n---\n\nYou can install TanStack Ranger with any [NPM](https://npmjs.com) package manager.\n\nDepending on your framework of choice, install one of the following packages:\n\n- [React](./framework/react/react-ranger.md)\n- Solid (coming soon!)\n- Vue (coming soon!)\n- Svelte (coming soon!)\n- Angular (coming soon!)\n"}
